# Frontend (Angular 20)

Full detail lives in `AGENTS.md` (Frontend + Angular sections). Apply these when editing under `frontend/`.

## Architecture

- **Standalone components only** — do not add NgModules.
- **DI:** `inject()` only; no constructor injection.
- **State:** signals, `computed()`; do not use `signal.mutate()` — use `update` / `set`.
- **Change detection:** `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush` on components.
- **APIs:** `input()` / `output()` instead of `@Input` / `@Output` decorators.

## Templates

- Native control flow: `@if`, `@for`, `@switch` — not `*ngIf` / `*ngFor` / `*ngSwitch`.
- **Styling:** `class` / `style` bindings — not `ngClass` / `ngStyle`.
- **Host:** use `host: { ... }` on `@Component` / `@Directive` — not `@HostBinding` / `@HostListener`.
- Prefer **Reactive forms** over template-driven for new forms.

## Async and cleanup

- Prefer `async` pipe for observables in templates where appropriate.
- Subscribe only with cleanup: `takeUntilDestroyed()` or `takeUntil(...)`.

## i18n and UI copy

- No hardcoded Bulgarian (or other) user-facing strings — use `@ngx-translate/core` keys.

## Images

- Use `NgOptimizedImage` for static images; not for inline base64.

## Routing

- Lazy-load feature routes where the app already does (follow existing `app.routes` / feature patterns).

## E2E

- Playwright only (not Cypress), when adding or changing E2E tests.

## Canonical examples (copy style from here)

- Shell / root: `frontend/src/app/app.component.ts`
- Feature UI: any component under `frontend/src/app/features/` (e.g. `frontend/src/app/features/auth/login/login.component.ts`)
